name: corpus-hygiene
kind: declared
shape: count
face: in
membrane: false
note: |
  Fires when the corpus is found asserting something about itself that is no
  longer true — a test comment claiming a red/green state the harness contradicts,
  or a doc describing a pin as a gap when the pin is a deliberate wall. Value is
  the number of such divergences found in one sweep.

  Attention-worthy because the suite has no verdict on prose that describes it:
  these lie silently, and the generated learn pages carry them outward.

  Detector:
    grep -rlE "RED PIN|fails today|currently (red|failing|broken)|goes green when|PINNED FAILING|NOT yet supported" tests/regression --include="input.k*"
  then cross-check each against test-results/latest.json before believing it.
